            "process": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "DBT Registration Process:",
                    "underline": true
                  }
                ],
                "type": "block_quote"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 1: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Visit the "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "registration page"
                      }
                    ],
                    "link": "https://dbtagriculture.bihar.gov.in/RegFarmer/",
                    "type": "link"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " of the DBT portal. "
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 2:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Select Aadhaar verification type: OTP/ BIO-AUTH/ IRIS."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 3: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Enter your Aadhaar number and Name as per Aadhaar. Click on “Authentication”."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 4:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Enter the OTP. Click on “Validate OTP”. "
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 5: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Now confirm the details about the “Kisan Credit Card (KCC)” Details. Click on “Farmer Registration”."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 6:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " In the Registration Page, fill in all the details properly i.e. Farmer details, Land information, Bank account details and click on “Submit”."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 7: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Validate with OTP. Click on “Register” to generate the Registration Id."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Note:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "  After 48 hours of registration, farmers can apply for the scheme with the help of 13 digit registration number."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "block_quote"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "",
                    "underline": true
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Online Application of the Scheme:",
                    "underline": true
                  }
                ],
                "type": "block_quote"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 1:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Visit the official "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "website"
                      }
                    ],
                    "link": "https://horticulture.bihar.gov.in/HortMIS/InputBasedStateScheme/OnlineAppCoconutSchemeState.aspx",
                    "type": "link"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". "
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 2:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Scroll to bottom and confirm the checkbox. Click on “Proceed to apply”."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 3:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " In the next page select the “Type of Applicant” and enter the “DBT Registration Number of Kisan”. Click on “Get details”."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 4: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Fill in the required details i.e. Address, Land Details, etc, and upload documents."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 5: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Confirm the checkbox and then click on “Submit”."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 6:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " An “Application Number” will be generated. Keep this for future reference."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 7:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Printout of the filled in application also can be taken using the Print option."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "process_md": "> **DBT Registration Process:**\n\n**Step 1:** Visit the [registration page](https://dbtagriculture.bihar.gov.in/RegFarmer/) of the DBT portal. \n**Step 2:** Select Aadhaar verification type: OTP/ BIO-AUTH/ IRIS.\n**Step 3:** Enter your Aadhaar number and Name as per Aadhaar. Click on “Authentication”.\n**Step 4:** Enter the OTP. Click on “Validate OTP”. \n**Step 5:** Now confirm the details about the “Kisan Credit Card (KCC)” Details. Click on “Farmer Registration”.\n**Step 6:** In the Registration Page, fill in all the details properly i.e. Farmer details, Land information, Bank account details and click on “Submit”.\n**Step 7:** Validate with OTP. Click on “Register” to generate the Registration Id.\n> **Note:**  After 48 hours of registration, farmers can apply for the scheme with the help of 13 digit registration number.\n\n<br>\n\n> **Online Application of the Scheme:**\n\n**Step 1:** Visit the official [website](https://horticulture.bihar.gov.in/HortMIS/InputBasedStateScheme/OnlineAppCoconutSchemeState.aspx). \n**Step 2:** Scroll to bottom and confirm the checkbox. Click on “Proceed to apply”.\n**Step 3:** In the next page select the “Type of Applicant” and enter the “DBT Registration Number of Kisan”. Click on “Get details”.\n**Step 4:** Fill in the required details i.e. Address, Land Details, etc, and upload documents.\n**Step 5:** Confirm the checkbox and then click on “Submit”.\n**Step 6:** An “Application Number” will be generated. Keep this for future reference.\n**Step 7:** Printout of the filled in application also can be taken using the Print option.\n"
          }
        ],
